   "": {
    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend part U of chapter 56 of the laws of 2018, amending the\neducation law relating to requiring regulations to permit tuition waivers for\ncertain firefighters and fire officers for CUNY, in relation to the\neffectiveness thereof",
    "basePrintNo": "S9129",
